# ==============================================================================
# OPERATION DUMB BUNNY — .gitignore
# ENCOM Grid // OSI Bionic Lab — Derezzing Transient Clutter Only
# ==============================================================================
# NOTE: All mission artifacts are INTENTIONALLY TRACKED in this repository:
#   - Source code & rules:    src/, tracker/, .agents/, GEMINI.md
#   - Original HEIC photos:   pics/
#   - Calibrated ref plates:  work/ref_images/, work/textures/
#   - Telemetry & QA reports: work/tracker_state.json, work/measurements.json,
#                             work/face_blueprint.json, work/qa_report.json
#   - Docs & screenshots:     README.md, docs/
#   - Blender project file:   models/dumb_bunny.blend
#   - 3D printable exports:   output/ (.stl, .obj, .mtl, face_repaired.png)
#   - Live viewport renders:  tracker/live_renders/
# ==============================================================================

# macOS Finder metadata
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
._*

# Python bytecode & caches
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Transient Blender Live GUI IPC file queue & atomic write temps
work/blender_ipc/
*.tmp
**/*.tmp

# Blender auto-backup files (keep models/dumb_bunny.blend!)
models/*.blend1
models/*.blend2
*.blend1
*.blend2

# Editor & OS scratch files
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.vscode/
.idea/
